&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;I love the game SABLE by SHEDWORKS. It&amp;#39;s probably my favorite game, and a really under-rated gem. This is my tribute to the game, and to the fans of game who, like me, have wanted a little physical model of Sable for their shelves or desks.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;The Hakoa top and bottom are my favorite pieces of clothing in the game, so I created this version of Sable dressed in them. I&amp;#39;ve included two versions, one with the iconic Ibexii mask and one with the Scrapper mask, which is how Sable appears in my playthrough (screenshot attached.)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;She&amp;#39;s scaled for 28mm gaming, but you can also scale her up to any size that you like.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;I really, really hope that we get to see more of SABLE&amp;#39;s world in the future. It&amp;#39;s really an amazing experience of a game.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
